# Frontend — Control Plane (React)

## Stack
- **UI:** **React** with **TypeScript**
- **Build:** **Vite**
- **Styling:** **TailwindCSS**
- **HTTP client:** **Axios**

## Code principles (mandatory)
- **Components:** functional components only (no class components).
- **Business logic:** encapsulate in **custom hooks**; keep components thin.
- **Separation:** use **Container / Presenter** pattern — containers (hooks + orchestration) vs presentational components (props in, UI out).
